{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上如羊切，壤平聲。下丘於切，音區。亦云霜佉。此翻貝，乃珂貝耳。賢愚經云勝伽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "銀藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明月珠藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瑠璃藏，亦名珂貝藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義昧無盡故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能生妙善故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楷定邪正\n故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "理示正能故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貫穿諸法故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相續中眠，故名隨眠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二是地前修因行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此行\n在於地住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二皆是從果起應之行。同生善邊，名嬰兒行。從大\n慈根起，同煩惱邊，名為病行，從大悲根起。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約經立名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約處立名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約法\n立名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱約經立名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指周穆王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此出佛升忉利經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵名吉由羅，或枳由邏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一法、二義、三呪術、四忍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勸昏倒眾生醒悟，上求下化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勸牢強精進，止惡行善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "感生梵天妙報悅心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經論開人眼目，融通解結出籠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法界雖無始終通塞，\n豁然大朗，無礙自在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音綿，交覆深屋也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准佛昇忉利說法經，在歡喜園圓生樹下，三月安居，四眾圍繞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六凡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古制字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隱字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問地獄經云：住獄間城，縱廣三萬里，\n金銀所成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自、他、共、離四種性計"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四性既離，即知無生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六律黃鍾，十一月。釋名曰鍾空也，空內受氣多，故聲大。白虎通曰鍾之為言，動也，陰\n氣用事，萬物動成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音藥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孟康曰：槩欲其直，故\n\n以水平之。井水清，清明平也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音閤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圭，自然之形，陰陽之\n始。四圭曰撮，三指撮之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡設施之施平聲，施與之施去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有言堅首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名恒憍"}
{"id": null, "n": "0643001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0643001", "type": "orig", "text": "波下疑脫羅字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0650001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0650001", "type": "orig", "text": "故疑施"}
